'''Sarukani''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] gains increased health, immunity to Weaken and lower time between attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

