==Trivia==
*This unit is based on the Japanese folktale "Saru-Kani" ([[wikipedia:The Crab and the Monkey|The Crab and the Monkey]]), which is about a monkey who kills a crab by throwing [[wikipedia:Persimmon|persimmons]] (or kaki: there are many versions) on it, leading to retribution from the crab's offspring and its allies.
*The Rock Revengers are a reference to the rock band [[wikipedia:Kiss (band)|Kiss]].
**Each member also references a character in the original folktale: the bee (left), the nut (right), the crab's offspring (center/lead singer), the mortar (battery) and the monkey (tied on the cross). For some reason, the last main character, the cow dung, is missing (which is probably okay).
*This unit was released shortly after [[Daboo of the Dead]] as one of the first [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] Cats. It is thus likely that they were specifically designed to counter [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Dead on Debut]].

